==============================================================================
MODEL AND ASSUMPTIONS: HP-MT (equivalent hollow-sphere particle + Mori-Tanaka),
cross-checked with HP-DS (differential scheme) and bracketed by Hashin-Shtrikman bounds.
Linear elastic, perfectly bonded, monodisperse, non-interacting spheres; no matrix
porosity, no particle crushing, small strain. Experimental syntactic-foam moduli are
typically 20-40% BELOW HP-MT (matrix porosity, particle breakage, imperfect bonding),
so treat the reported E as an upper-ish estimate and design with margin.
